RentnerProxy rebuilds pristine upstream CrowdSec and cscli sources with the
reviewed dependency workspace in docker/crowdsec/tooling/engine-build/.
Upstream source files and go.mod/go.sum remain unchanged. The binaries use
Go 1.27.2, gRPC v1.84.0, golang.org/x/crypto v0.58.0 and golang.org/x/net
v0.61.0. Only the unused PostgreSQL database backend is excluded through
upstream's supported EXCLUDE=db_postgres build option; the managed appliance
uses SQLite. All other default features remain enabled, including MySQL.
RE2 retains the upstream 2023-03-01 static build. Configuration and Hub assets
still originate from the pinned official CrowdSec image and Hub snapshot below.

